15 oct, late

the checkpoint yesterday was a disaster. 9 second boot on the projector laptop, the terminal froze in front of the panel, the search showed "model loading". I could feel my face getting hot. Bob kept talking and saved us a bit. I didn't sleep much.

I keep thinking it's my fault because I pushed for showing semantic search even though the model wasn't cached. Dan said it's everyone's fault, which is kind but not true.

Called Nani. She said "one bad day is one bad day". Going to write the post-mortem properly tomorrow and make a checklist so it never happens again. Also going to stop working past 2 am.
